{"_id":"68d8c720125efdb0fe9c9cef","title":"Bring NPC","game":{"_id":"68cc4ddaea91876ce13d6172","gameId":118384840573608,"name":"[💪] Be a Bodybuilder","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/012aeead4a497b87ff485f8bcfb696d3b6c0a497f635b25311a9ac14c4c526b6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-a488e7fa5e85846417bbab3008a5ef82-580ebd10d98e.png"},"slug":"118384840573608-be-a-bodybuilder","path":"/game/118384840573608-be-a-bodybuilder","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/012aeead4a497b87ff485f8bcfb696d3b6c0a497f635b25311a9ac14c4c526b6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-a488e7fa5e85846417bbab3008a5ef82-580ebd10d98e.png"},"placeId":118384840573608},"slug":"Be-a-Bodybuilder-Bring-NPC-55380","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":4312,"executes":112,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/569b9a7a696157e47eba24fb6d8a928bec7c690bea9cba4a596912c9b2c3b906.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/118384840573608-1759037216390.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/118384840573608-1759037216390.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/569b9a7a696157e47eba24fb6d8a928bec7c690bea9cba4a596912c9b2c3b906.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/118384840573608-1759037216390.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/118384840573608-1759037216390.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-09-28T05:26:56.411Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-28T05:26:56.411Z","lastBump":"2025-09-28T05:26:56.411Z","script":"local ScreenGui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\nScreenGui.Name = \"NPCGui\"\nScreenGui.Parent = game:GetService(\"CoreGui\")\n\nlocal Button = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nButton.Size = UDim2.new(0, 200, 0, 50)\nButton.Position = UDim2.new(0.5, -100, 0.8, 0)\nButton.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(50, 50, 50)\nButton.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\nButton.Font = Enum.Font.SourceSansBold\nButton.TextSize = 18\nButton.Text = \"Teleport NPCs\"\nButton.Parent = ScreenGui\n\nlocal function teleportNPCs()\n    local player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n    local character = player.Character or player.CharacterAdded:Wait()\n    local hrp = character:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n\n    if hrp then\n        local npcsFolder = game:GetService(\"Workspace\"):FindFirstChild(\"NPCs\")\n        if npcsFolder then\n            for _, npcFolder in pairs(npcsFolder:GetChildren()) do\n                for _, npc in pairs(npcFolder:GetChildren()) do\n                    local npcHRP = npc:FindFirstChild(\"HumanoidRootPart\")\n                    if npcHRP then\n                        npcHRP.CFrame = hrp.CFrame * CFrame.new(0, 0, -5)\n\n                        for _, part in pairs(npc:GetDescendants()) do\n                            if part:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n                                part.CanCollide = false\n                            end\n                        end\n                    end\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nButton.MouseButton1Click:Connect(teleportNPCs)","features":"Its just a button that brings the npc to you. Literally made with chatgpt and it's very bad but it works\n\n- click the button once to teleport the npcs\n\nalso it breaks the game like in the thumbnail for some reason (they spawn like that after you kill them).","tags":["bodybuilder","be a bodybuilder","bring npc"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65a9e768c314fef692a22a7c","username":"Schwii","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a23df19eff72630d2a71c39da60d494e42fed24cb92ea746a03625ed674057fa.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/65a9e768c314fef692a22a7c-1732981689837.png"},"status":"offline","id":"65a9e768c314fef692a22a7c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a23df19eff72630d2a71c39da60d